        "body": "The Department of Justice has obligated $98.1M in FY2027 to date, compared with $10.2B in FY26 and $9.3B in FY24. Obligations fell 99.0% year over year. FY22 through FY26 totals were $9B, $10B, $9.3B, $8.6B, and $10.2B respectively."
      },
